WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.847
Who presses Dial?

00:00:04.847 --> 00:00:06.852
In Preview, the agent.

00:00:06.852 --> 00:00:10.503
In Power, Progressive and Predictive, nobody.

00:00:10.503 --> 00:00:12.150
The system dials.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.493
Is an agent held before the customer's phone rings?

00:00:16.493 --> 00:00:19.267
Yes in Preview, Power and Progressive.

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:23.680
In Predictive, yes by default, and no when you choose Over-dial.

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:26.405
Can a call be abandoned?

00:00:26.405 --> 00:00:27.919
Never in Preview.

00:00:27.919 --> 00:00:32.790
In Power and Progressive, when an agent cannot be connected in time.

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:37.990
In Predictive, the same, and on purpose in Over-dial when nobody is free.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:40.195
Which features?

00:00:40.195 --> 00:00:44.004
Contact Center Outbound Dialer gives you Preview.

00:00:44.004 --> 00:00:49.130
Contact Center Paced Dialing adds Power, Progressive and Predictive.

